WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.130
Grind a green leaf and
extract its pigments.

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.800
The extract looks like one shade of green.

3
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.980
Spot it on paper and
let a solvent creep up.

4
00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.860
It splits into several spots:
orange, yellow and two greens.

5
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.210
Each spot is a different pigment.

6
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.710
One spot in, a ladder out.

7
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.360
So how do you work out what each spot is?

8
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:25.590
In this mission, you'll see why some
molecules race up the paper while others

9
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.990
lag behind.

10
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.880
Then you'll run a chromatogram yourself,
from pencil line to solvent front.

11
00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:36.440
Your mission: work out how to
identify every spot on a chromatogram.
